## LLM calls

All Claude API calls go through `pipeline/`. Never import `anthropic` directly
in routers or services.

```python
# ✅ correct
from pipeline.llm import generate_visual_query

# ❌ wrong — anthropic is not allowed outside pipeline/
import anthropic
client = anthropic.Anthropic(...)
```
-->

