## Style invariants

Enforced by `scripts/check_style.py` (post-write hook + pre-commit).
Each violation prints a `REMEDIATION:` line — read it and fix in-place.

### File size

No source file may exceed **{{MAX_FILE_LINES}}** lines. If a file is
approaching the ceiling, split it along a clear seam: one type per file,
one concern per module. Files at the ceiling are almost always doing
too much.

